# 🔍 Full Project Audit — Alpha CRM

## Executive Summary

The project has **57 backend modules** and **37 frontend pages**. The vast majority are **fully implemented and API-connected**. However, **6 frontend pages are UI-only shells** (they render beautifully but use hardcoded demo data instead of live API calls).

---

## Backend (NestJS) — ✅ Fully Implemented

All 57 modules have service files, controllers, and are registered in `AppModule`. Nothing is missing or scaffolded.

| Category | Modules | Status |
|:---|:---|:---:|
| **Core CRM** | Auth, Leads, Contacts, Companies, Deals | ✅ Live |
| **Communication** | Calls, WhatsApp, Communications, Telephony, Inbox | ✅ Live |
| **Productivity** | Tasks, Notes, Calendar, Documents, Projects | ✅ Live |
| **Sales Ops** | Campaigns, Campaign Engine, Quotes, Products, Invoices, Sales Orders, Payments | ✅ Live |
| **Automation** | Workflows, Dialer, Queue, AI, Webhooks | ✅ Live |
| **Analytics** | Reports, Audit Logs, Search, Gamification | ✅ Live |
| **Admin** | Settings (via Auth), Custom Fields, Custom Objects, Business Hours | ✅ Live |
| **Support** | Tickets, Knowledge Base, Surveys | ✅ Live |
| **Other** | Attachments, Storage, Notifications, Marketing, Approvals, HR Leaves, Assets, Vendors, Events, Integrations, Agent Management | ✅ Live |

---

