### ⚠️ UI-Only Shells (6 pages) — Beautiful UI, but hardcoded demo data

These pages render a polished interface with **static/sample data baked into the component**. They do NOT call backend APIs. The backend modules for these exist and work — the frontend just hasn't been wired up yet.

| Page | Lines | What's Missing |
|:---|:---:|:---|
| `/approvals` | 63 | Needs SWR call to `/approvals` API |
| `/assets` | 62 | Needs SWR call to `/assets` API |
| `/chains` | 122 | Needs SWR call to workflow chains API |
| `/custom-objects` | 82 | Needs SWR call to `/custom-objects` API |
| `/hr` | 93 | Needs SWR call to `/hr-leaves` API |
| `/web-forms` | 72 | Needs SWR call to web-forms API |

> [!NOTE]
> These 6 pages are **not broken** — they load and display correctly. They just show hardcoded sample data instead of real database content. The backend APIs they need already exist and are registered.

