### What's Stable and Production-Ready
- ✅ Authentication & Role-based access
- ✅ Full CRM pipeline (Lead → Contact → Company → Deal)
- ✅ Telephony & Call management
- ✅ WhatsApp integration
- ✅ Campaign engine with dialer
- ✅ AI module (transcription, summary, sentiment)
- ✅ Reporting & Analytics dashboards
- ✅ Workflow automation engine
- ✅ Real-time WebSocket updates

### What Needs Wiring (Optional — not broken, just static UI)
- ⚠️ 6 frontend pages need API connection (Approvals, Assets, Chains, Custom Objects, HR, Web Forms)
